    GC_Briefing "{3AF7648D492243D1}" {
     m_iOrder 0
     m_sTitle "Briefing: Situation."
     m_sContent "Description textI. Situation"\
     "Germany, 2026. The 8th Guards Army has rolled over Fulda in a day and the US V Corps has been reduced by half. We have taken Bad Orb and we are continuing towards Frankfurt. US forces are conducting a fighting retreat towards the city."\
     ""\
     "The 39th Guards Motor Rifle Regiment is fighting down the A66 highway and through the surrounding farmland. Our Motorized Recon Company (440) under the 389th Motor Rifle Regiment, has conducted a flank around the South of an American mechanized infantry company, who are holding the village of Kassel, in the farmland on the Southern Approach to the highway."\
     ""\
     "Local Time: Random"\
     "Weather: Random"\
     ""\
     "Friendly Forces: "\
     "	1x Motorized Recon Company (440) equipped with K-17 Bumerang IFVs (30mm Autocannons / Kornet-EM ATGMs)."\
     ""\
     "Enemy Forces: "\
     "	1x Company(-) of US Army Mechanized Infantry in M1296 Dragoons (30mm), M1126 Strykers (CROWS), and JLTVs. "\
     "	Infantry consists of standard Army and Rangers."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "RHS_AFRF"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{87275D41412DE55D}" {
     m_iOrder 1
     m_sTitle "Briefing: Situation."
     m_sContent "I. Situation"\
     "Germany, 2026. The 8th Guards Army has rolled over Fulda in a day and the US V Corps has been reduced by half. The enemy has taken Bad Orb and we are conducting a fighting retreat towards Frankfurt."\
     "Our Company is defending the Southern Approach to the A66 highway in the town of Kassel. Scouts have reported that there is an incoming Russian Motorized Recon Company (44th Coy) from the East."\
     ""\
     "Local Time: Random"\
     "Weather: Random"\
     ""\
     "Friendly Forces (PLAYERS):"\
     "	1x FO pair (Foxbat 4'1)"\
     "	1x Mortar Team (Foxbat 4'3 - 1x Tube) - Unlimited HE, SMK,ILLM, x5 PGMs"\
     "	location: 000 009"\
     ""\
     "Friendly Forces (AI): "\
     "	Mechanized Infantry Main Body utilizing M1296 Dragoons (30mm), M1126 Strykers, and JLTVs."\
     ""\
     "Enemy Forces: "\
     "	1x Company(-) of Russian Motorized Recon (440) in K-17 Bumerangs."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "RHS_USAF"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{8BC5DC721ECA3212}" {
     m_iOrder 2
     m_sTitle "Briefing: Mission."
     m_sContent "II. Mission"\
     "440 has been tasked with securing the approach to the A66 highway by destroying the US mechanized company defending the village of Kassel and the surrounding farmland."\
     ""\
     "Clear the platoons between us and Kassel from their positions."\
     "Seize Kassel."\
     "Hold the route North of Kassel against any counterattack."\
     ""\
     "III. Execution"\
     "As Per CO's intent."\
     ""\
     "IV. Command/Signals"\
     "	Radio Net: 42.0 MHz (Single Channel)."\
     "	Company HQ: 440 (CO + RTO)."\
     "	1st Platoon (441 HQ): 441, 442, 443."\
     "	2nd Platoon (444 HQ): 444, 445, 446."\
     ""\
     "V. Service/Support"\
     "No Fire Support."\
     "No Resupply."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "RHS_AFRF"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{694A0028A3F6CCF3}" {
     m_iOrder 3
     m_sTitle "Briefing: Mission."
     m_sContent "II. Mission"\
     "Our mortar tube is the only remaining one in the company; assist the company in disrupting the enemy attack from the EAST."\
     "Disrupt the advance of K-17 columns in the eastern farmlands."\
     "Suppress ATGM and infantry positions to protect our AI Stryker Dragoons."\
     "Provide fire support for the company defense within Kassel."\
     ""\
     "III. Execution"\
     "As Per CO's intent."\
     ""\
     "IV. Command/Signals"\
     "	Fire Support Net (Manpack): 48.0 MHz. "\
     "	HQ: Foxbat 6 (CO + RTO)."\
     ""\
     "V. Service/Support"\
     "	No External Fire Support. "\
     "	No Resupply. "
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "RHS_USAF"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{7AE4883D4037645C}" {
     m_iOrder 4
     m_sTitle "Briefing: Notes."
     m_sContent "VI. End Conditions:"\
     "Time Limit - Unlimited"\
     ""\
     "AFRF Win:"\
     "All Objective Seized."\
     ""\
     "US Win:"\
     "80% AFRF Casualties."
    }
    GC_Briefing "{48F30A2D544B7658}" {
     m_iOrder 5
     m_sTitle "Briefing: K17 Weapons & Keys"
     m_sContent "2026-02-07, 9М113М is broken."\
     ""\
     "Weapons"\
     "30mm 3УБР6 (3UBR6)"\
     "- Solid-shot Armor Piercing Tracer (AP-T) for neutralizing enemy APCs and light vehicles."\
     ""\
     "30mm 3УОФ8 (3UOF8)"\
     "- High-Explosive Incendiary (HE-I) for engaging infantry, soft targets, and buildings."\
     ""\
     "7.62mm ПКТМ (PKTM)"\
     "- Coaxial machine gun for anti-infantry suppression and preserving 30mm ammunition."\
     ""\
     "135mm 9М113М (Konkurs-M)"\
     "- Wire-guided anti-tank missile (ATGM) with tandem charge for destroying Main Battle Tanks."\
     ""\
     "81mm Система 902 «Туча» (Tucha)"\
     "- Smoke grenade launchers for immediate visual concealment and breaking enemy line of sight."\
     ""\
     "Keybindings"\
     "- Zoom in - \"+\""\
     "- Zoom Out - \"-\""\
     "- Zoom in/out \"Alt + Scroll up/down\""\
     "- Next Weapon - Hold \"V\""\
     ""\
     "- 3УБР6 - \"1\""\
     "- 3УОФ8 - \"2\""\
     "- ПКТМ - \"3\""\
     "- 9М113М - \"4\" (Broken)"\
     "- «Туча» - \"5\""\
     ""\
     "- Toggle Turret Stabilization - \"Space\""\
     "- Messure Distance (Use Laser Rangerfinder(ADS)) - \"C\""\
     "-- Click once to lase, click again to range it"\
     ""\
     "Rearming"\
     "- You have what you start with, you cannot rearm any of the weapons even if it says 0/160."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "RHS_AFRF"
     }
    }
   }
